    "spec.tanks": "Tanks", "spec.tanks.t": "2 to 8", "spec.lic": "License", "spec.pd": "public domain", "spec.pdu": "public domain (Unlicense)",
    "howto.h": "How to play",
    "howto.p": "Each tank starts in its own base. Dig through the dirt (rock can't be dug), find the enemy and shoot it. Moving costs energy, digging costs more, and shooting the most. Any base refuels you; your own base repairs your shield, and a teammate's does too, more slowly. Firing while you move digs faster. Win the set number of rounds to win the match.",
    "keys.h": "Keys", "keys.move": "Move", "keys.fire": "Fire",
